menu "Grillo USB"
    config GRILLO_USB_DEBUG_CDC
        bool "Add a CDC-ACM debug console to every USB profile"
        default y
        help
            When TinyUSB owns the USB PHY the USB-Serial-JTAG console is gone.
            With this option every profile (HID, MSC) also exposes a CDC-ACM
            serial port carrying stdout and the ESP-IDF logs. Disable it for
            release builds to present only the functional interfaces.
endmenu
